[I] Manage KDE passwords

[T] KWalletManager is a tool to manage the passwords on the system. Using
[T] the KDE Frameworks wallet subsystem, it allows keeping one's own secrets
[T] and also accessing and managing the passwords of every application that
[T] integrates with the wallet.

[U] https://invent.kde.org/utilities/kwalletmanager

[A] The KDE-Team
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

